A20TEST.COM - the A20 gate, reached through the hardware
  on entry the gate is shut
  port 92h:
    OK   set: the wrap is gone
    OK   cleared: the wrap is back
    OK   reads back what it was written
  keyboard controller:
    OK   D1h output port bit 1 clear: wrap present
    OK   D1h output port bit 1 set: wrap gone
    OK   D0h reads the output port back correctly
    OK   D0h again, gate shut: bit 1 clear, no stale state
    OK   DDh shortcut: wrap present
    OK   DFh shortcut: wrap gone
  INT 15h AH=24h:
    OK   2400h disable: wrap present
    OK   2401h enable: wrap gone
    OK   2402h agrees the gate is open
  and does XMS agree?
    OK   function 07h tracked the hardware both ways
A20TEST done - and the kernel is still here
